{"schema_version":"1.0.0","id":"cik-0001830188","cik":"0001830188","slug":"united-homes-group-830188","name":"United Homes Group, Inc.","ticker":"UHG","exchanges":["Nasdaq","Nasdaq"],"sector":"Operative Builders","sic":"1531","country":"SC","website":"","listed_years":5.3,"first_annual":"2021-03-31","last_filing":"2026-05-14","annual_only":false,"edgar_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001830188&type=10-K","summary":{"sentences":["United Homes Group, Inc. is operative builders, classified by the SEC under \"Operative Builders\", based in SC.","It reported $401.9m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, down 23.5% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 17.7%.","Listed on Nasdaq, Nasdaq, it funds itself from operations ($16.9m of operating cash flow over the year)."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $16.9m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1830188/000183018825000036/0001830188-25-000036-index.htm","accession":"0001830188-25-000036"}],"bear":[{"text":"Revenue fell 23.5% year on year (Q3 2025 vs Q3 2024). Whatever the story is, it is not currently showing up in sales.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1830188/000183018825000079/0001830188-25-000079-index.htm","accession":"0001830188-25-000079"},{"text":"Gross margin compressed from 18.9% to 17.7% against the same quarter a year earlier. Either input costs are rising or the company is discounting to hold volume.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1830188/000183018825000079/0001830188-25-000079-index.htm","accession":"0001830188-25-000079"},{"text":"Gross margin is only 17.7%, so scale has to be enormous before anything reaches the bottom line.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1830188/000183018825000079/0001830188-25-000079-index.htm","accession":"0001830188-25-000079"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-1.7% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1830188/000183018825000079/0001830188-25-000079-index.htm","accession":"0001830188-25-000079"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $5.2m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1830188/000183018825000079/0001830188-25-000079-index.htm","accession":"0001830188-25-000079"},{"text":"Diluted share count rose 21.5% over the year (Q3 2025 vs Q3 2024). The company can grow while your share of it shrinks, and this is the number most commentary ignores.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1830188/000183018825000079/0001830188-25-000079-index.htm","accession":"0001830188-25-000079"},{"text":"Debt of $145.6m against equity of $57.4m. Leverage decides who controls the outcome if trading deteriorates, and it is not the shareholder.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1830188/000183018826000009/0001830188-26-000009-index.htm","accession":"0001830188-26-000009"},{"text":"No officer history could be reconstructed from public filings, so the team - the thing that matters most - is the thing we know least about.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001830188"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 10.0% for 2 consecutive quarters",